        geometry = 50 mm reference cell (r25 mesh). rel.perm S_e^3; rho_s=2780; pellet
        macro retention               : SaturationTuller.  *** HEADER CORRECTED 2026-08-31
                       (§6.7(1) header–value consistency). *** This block previously read
                       "retention P0=27MPa,a=0.45", i.e. it documented a van Genuchten curve
