        alpha_M phenomenological.
        specific_surface=523 m2/g     : EPFL family (CLAUDE.md 12.1 family 2): Seiphoori, Ferrari & Laloui
                       (2014), Geotechnique 64(9):721-734, Tab. 1 p. 724, in m2/g. RULED Vinay
